 egister students before the November midterm election. Democracy functions
  best when people engage in conversations about what needs to be done. Whe
 n we register voters\, we don't start by pushing a form. Using the Field T
 eam 6 model\, we ask questions and talk about problems that need to be add
 ressed. We talk about how voting can be a way to get decision makers w
LOCATION:Woodland Community College: Rose Garden in Center of Campus\, 230
 0 E Gibson Rd\, Woodland\, CA\, 95776
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/952227/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
