 is workshop is open to everyone ages 16 and up- no art experience required
 .\n\nBeginning Charcoal Drawing\nSaturday\\\, June 27 \\| 11:30 AM \\- 3:3
 0 PM\n$75 Members\, $95 Non-Members (All materials included)\n\n**Registra
 tion is required through the [Pence's website (CLICK HERE)](https://penceg
 allery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions?
