SUMMARY:UC Davis Farmers Market – Spring Season
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T133000
UID:10000822-1785924000-1785936600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Fresh\, local\, and back on campus! The UC Davis Farmers Mark
 et returns this spring on the south patio outside the Student Community Ce
 nter. \n🗓 Wednesdays | April 1 – May 27⏰ 10:00 AM – 1:30 PM📍
  Student Community Center \nShop and enjoy:• Fresh\, locally grown prod
 uce & flowers• New vendors• A vibrant\, healthy campus community \nThe
  market supports local agriculture while making fresh\, nutritious food ac
 cessible on campus. \nVisit to get fresh produce and flowers\, talk to loc
 al growers and support local agriculture. \nEBT\, cash\, debit\, credit\, 
 AggieFresh\, Market Dollars and Aggie Cash accepted. \n🥕 Stop by\, supp
 ort local\, and eat well\, see you there!
LOCATION:UC Davis\, 1 Shields Ave\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/uc-davis-farmers-market-spring-season/
 2026-08-05/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-08-05/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Picnic in the Park at Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings 
 (50th Anniversary Year)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T200000
UID:10000887-1785945600-1785960000@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The beloved Picnic in the Park season is back at the Davis Far
 mers Market starting Wednesday\, April 1\, 2026! \nEvery Wednesday evening
  through August 26\, the market expands to 4:00 – 8:00 PM\, turning Cent
 ral Park into the perfect spot for a relaxed picnic dinner. Shop fresh pro
 duce\, artisan goods\, and a wide variety of prepared foods from your favo
 rite vendors. Enjoy local craft beer\, wine\, and brand new this year – 
 mead! \nEach week features live music and children’s activities\, creati
 ng a festive\, family-friendly atmosphere. Bring blankets\, lawn chairs\, 
 and reusable bags. It’s the ideal way to unwind\, connect with neighbors
 \, and support local farmers and food makers. \nThis year is extra special
  as the Davis Farmers Market celebrates its 50th Anniversary! Don’t miss
  the big anniversary celebration on Saturday\, August 1\, 2026. \nNew in 2
 026: The Market Memories Cookbook (presale now at davis-farmers-market). \
 nHighlights Include: \n\nBuckhorn Food Truck\, The Hotdogger\, Dhillon Far
 m\, Davis Bread & Desserts\, Greek Table\, Kettle Pop & more\nLive music e
 very week\nKids’ activities\nLocal beer\, wine & mead\n\nFree to attend 
 – everyone is welcome!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-08-05/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
